## Apiary toolkit

This repo was spawned by `/incubator` and ships with the apiary toolkit wired up. Invoke any apiary subsystem via the launcher:

```bash
python ~/.claude/apiary_launch.py <subsystem>/<script>.py [args]
```

Per-repo state lives under `.apiary/`. Common entry points:

```bash
python ~/.claude/apiary_launch.py scribe/notes.py list             # operational notes for this project
python ~/.claude/apiary_launch.py scribe/notes.py list --type context  # specs and project context
python ~/.claude/apiary_launch.py budgeter/report.py --since 7d    # session cost rollup
```

The full project spec produced during incubation lives as a `context`-type scribe note in this repo — run `scribe/notes.py list --type context` to find it.
